  "decision_conditions": [
    "Planning permission is not required by virtue of Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 as while the proposed operation falls within Use Class C2 (Residential Institutions) due to the provision of care by non resident staff on a rotating shift basis, the scale and intensity of the use, limited to a maximum of three children, is such that it does not result in a material change in the character of the use from the existing Class C3 dwellinghouse. The proposal will continue to function in a manner consistent with a domestic residential environment."
